===Etymology===
From {{etyl|de|en}} {{term|Frankfurter||lang=de}}, the adjectival form of {{term|Frankfurt||lang=de}}. Specifically, a reference to [[Frankfurt-am-Main]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|UK|US|Canada|lang=en}} A moist [[sausage]] of soft, even texture and flavor, often made from mechanically recovered meat or meat slurry.

